      "jobId": "67ca8259-d911-4c18-ba8c-b55cae2a0877",
      "question": "Among the 50 most liquid US stocks, which 10 sessions from March 9 through March 12, 2026 traded the most shares, and how much of each session's volume came in its first and last 30 minutes?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T18:54:39.952823Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T18:55:00.388248Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top 10 highest-volume sessions among the 50 most liquid U.S. stocks, March 9–12, 2026**\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Session | Volume (shares) | First 30 min share | Last 30 min share |\n|------|--------|---------|-----------------|-------------------|-------------------|\n| 1 | NVDA | 2026-03-10 | 139,876,969 | 11.4% | 21.3% |\n| 2 | NVDA | 2026-03-09 | 128,373,684 | 13.8% | 24.9% |\n| 3 | NVDA | 2026-03-12 | 120,007,586 | 14.0% | 20.8% |\n| 4 | NVDA | 2026-03-11 | 109,103,827 | 16.8% | 21.3% |\n| 5 | INTC | 2026-03-10 | 73,447,676 | 19.6% | 15.0% |\n| 6 | INTC | 2026-03-09 | 70,810,191 | 16.9% | 26.1% |\n| 7 | INTC | 2026-03-12 | 69,597,310 | 13.6% | 19.7% |\n| 8 | ORCL | 2026-03-11 | 63,196,532 | 29.5% | 7.3% |\n| 9 | INTC | 2026-03-11 | 61,102,485 | 17.4% | 17.7% |\n| 10 | TSLA | 2026-03-09 | 53,894,243 | 15.4% | 15.1% |\n\n*Source: intraday minute-bar scan of the top_50 universe, 2026-03-09 through 2026-03-12 (regular session only; volume shares are fractions of each session’s total volume, including the closing auction in the last 30 minutes) [1]*\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — intraday scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:376b6c83e7f1e3043ca8b601c7dd30b3ed338b5a95d2bcefd6ab221ed5e4d74d`",
